- Noto Serif Hebrew, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/hebrew), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Bengali, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/bengali), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Devanagari, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/devanagari), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Ethiopic, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/ethiopic), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Thai and Noto Sans Thai, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/thai), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Khmer, Noto Serif Lao and Noto Serif Tibetan, Copyright 2022
  The Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts/khmer, /lao,
  /tibetan), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Georgian and Noto Serif Armenian, Copyright 2022 The Noto
  Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts/georgian, /armenian),
  without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Gujarati, Gurmukhi, Oriya, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam
  and Sinhala, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/gujarati, /gurmukhi, /oriya, /tamil,
  /telugu, /kannada, /malayalam, /sinhala), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif Myanmar, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/myanmar), without Reserved Font Name
- Noto Serif and Noto Sans, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic), without Reserved
