  (tools/fonts/NotoSerif-subset.ttf, NotoSans-subset.ttf)
- Noto Serif SC, Noto Serif TC and Noto Serif JP, Copyright 2017-2024
  Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), from github.com/google/fonts without
  Reserved Font Name, cut to the characters of the Chinese and Japanese
  letters plugins (tools/fonts/NotoSerif*-subset.ttf: a Modified Version,
  not distributed itself; the plugins carry bitmap packs made from it and
  the licence's text, NotoSerifCJK-OFL.txt)
- Nanum Myeongjo, Copyright 2010 NHN Corporation (http://www.nhncorp.com),
  with Reserved Font Names 'Nanum', 'Naver Nanum', 'NanumMyeongjo',
