  kept unmodified as tools/fonts/NanumMyeongjo-Regular.ttf. The Korean
  letters plugin (script-korean) draws from a bitmap pack made from it
  (the Hangul syllables of KS X 1001, rasterised): a Modified Version
  under the licence, so it is named Korean letters (korean.ppfp), not
  with a Reserved Font Name, and is licensed under the SIL Open Font
